333
00:22:59,342 --> 00:23:01,210
Olá? Olá?

334
00:23:01,590 --> 00:23:03,009
Merda!

335
00:23:04,724 --> 00:23:06,125
Ligue para Noah.

336
00:23:06,127 --> 00:23:07,536
<i>Ligando para Noah.</i>

337
00:23:09,284 --> 00:23:11,389
